{"3708660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DOCTOR VISCERA", "steam_appid": 3708660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/0595ddb360e094eff7e0d5f7c799c18d.poster.avif?t=1782425054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/0595ddb360e094eff7e0d5f7c799c18d.webm?t=1782425054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/0595ddb360e094eff7e0d5f7c799c18d.mp4?t=1782425054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Doctor Viscera</strong> is a survival horror game where you must escape the abandoned GrimmHaus Asylum while evading the Doctor and his grotesque experiments. Explore the castle's various rooms, find useful items, and solve puzzles to unlock new areas and discover escape routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/c9e307f12863e71ad50b4c5016a715c8.poster.avif?t=1782425054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/c9e307f12863e71ad50b4c5016a715c8.webm?t=1782425054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/c9e307f12863e71ad50b4c5016a715c8.mp4?t=1782425054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Explore, Solve, Survive...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for key items, solve puzzles, and unlock new areas as you desperately try to escape. But be careful, every wrong turn could lead straight into Doctor’s grasp.  <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/e51a66e337f0898047cc8f3cea8f266d.poster.avif?t=1782425054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/e51a66e337f0898047cc8f3cea8f266d.webm?t=1782425054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/e51a66e337f0898047cc8f3cea8f266d.mp4?t=1782425054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Five Never-Ending Nightmares...</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have five nights to survive the horrors of GrimmHaus Asylum. Explore different areas of the hospital, find tools such as a crowbar to unlock blocked passages, and solve puzzles to open new routes and shortcuts. Hide inside lockers, avoid making noise, and use stealth to evade Dr. Viscera. With limited inventory space, you'll need to manage your resources and store important items in safe locations. Every decision can bring you closer to freedom or a terrible fate.   <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3708660/extras/b7f0b4d56cdd28eaf3e6af16d906d096.poster.avif?t=1782425054\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"http